{
  "bookId": "hero-215001",
  "id": "bond-26026",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "26026001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "哇！这么大的房子，真漂亮。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26026002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "是送给樱的礼物。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26026003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "给樱的礼物？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26026004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "嗯，樱有很多朋友吧，不能总是在外面招待朋友，有这样的小屋，以后樱就能邀请朋友一起来家里玩了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26026005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "嗯嗯，樱想要找很多好朋友来做客。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26026006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "动物的朋友也可以来吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26026007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "当然，只要樱喜欢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26026008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "樱最喜欢主人了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26026009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "那~主人再等我一下。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26026010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "这么大的木牌，樱要写上什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26026011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "很快主人就知道了~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26026012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "锵锵锵！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26026013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "樱和主人的小屋，今日，挂牌营业~\n欢迎大家一起来玩。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26026014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "这也是主人的小屋，主人以后也要经常过来哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
